VHS7.png", "id": "1336902198285610", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827611_1336902201618943_4405919995820808436_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=e1lpCzcxo4AQ7kNvwGyfwos&_nc_oc=AdqLzCN-2oZrFIqy-9ECCuUoZw-qnCDb0RM4nwnnoYVMpXmF0lPPLnJ-24gYe4r8dUM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRK2y7cTi9LoPcby_4UZLI4hF9ekeMv7IKTZfk_XkTP7Q&oe=6AE9E5A8"}, {"file_name": "VHS4#.png", "id": "1125331169748393", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1125331176415059_1771831755847372883_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9X5hkAlc9RYQ7kNvwENw3kk&_nc_oc=Adp1wrDkgt_BzYuQ_zbIltNEyeXHuV2ORDOo7xyAQtyIJ_lKJKyCQ41ETVtxNYr2TXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7oOOWyb-z0M-HIdpNgfOP4eIhZbqRZ7rYiTTvLAFebg&oe=6AEA04DD"}, {"file_name": "VHS1.png", "id": "2708200546246037", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819281_2708200549579370_9168274898570661505_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9GPwt9yfBJAQ7kNvwGCtPcp&_nc_oc=Adq3Mdrpww6vsbrULMuL9J6sV8esC_GWPkiWkXIiZPPuzQY1dvxbV6QSTXsTjs5e_y8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSgr0kjmaGs_G2ykWlBBHTBf1poChsVHcYkulwLb1jpKg&oe=6AE9F5A3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Retro Video Store Simulator", "keywords": ["vhs", "retro", "video", "store", "simulator"], "long_description": "Retro Video Store Simulator \ud83d\udcfc\ud83c\udfea\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f\n\nStep into the golden age of physical media with Retro Video Store Simulator, an immersive video game store simulator in virtual reality where nostalgia meets management gameplay. Run your very own retro shop, stock shelves with classic retro VHS, DVDs, and video games, and build the ultimate destination for collectors and movie lovers alike.\n\nIn this highly detailed video store simulator, you\u2019ll handle everything from organizing inventory and managing rentals to setting prices and keeping customers happy. Experience the charm of the retro rewind era as you rewind tapes, recommend hidden gems, and grow your reputation as the best store in town.\n\nWhether you\u2019re a fan of a Video Store Simulator, a Video games simulator, or even a quirky DVD simulator and VHS simulator, this game delivers a unique blend of nostalgia and strategy. Customize your shop, expand your collection, and relive the magic of browsing shelves in a world before streaming. Be the owner of your really own VHS and DVD shop simulator back to the retro rewind VHS days of the 90s!\n\nCan you turn your humble shop into the ultimate retro empire?\n\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Step into the role of a retro VHS rental store owner and build your own nostalgic empire, retro rewind back to the 90s!\n\n\ud83d\udce6 Experience a full simulation of running a shop, from cashier duties to inventory management and business growth.\n\n\ud83d\udcb0 Stock your shelves, manage inventory, and buy & sell products to expand your store and increas", "short_description": "Welcome to Retro Video Store Simulator! \ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Whether you\u2019re a fan of a Video Store Simulator, Shop Simulator, Store Simulator, a video games simulator, or even a quirky VHS simulator - this game delivers a unique blend of nostalgia and strategy. Customize your shop, expand your collection by running your own vhs shop simulator. Be the owner of your really own VHS and DVD shop simulator back to the retro rewind VHS days of the 90s!\n\nAre you ready to run your own shop simulator for retro VHS cases?"}]}, "developer_name": "MB Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mbgamestudio.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MB Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://MbGameStudio.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "274332603592